    <string name="onboarding_auto_reply_disclosure">Auto-reply is ON by default — SMS Filter will automatically send a one-word \"stop\" or \"end\" reply when it detects an opt-out message from an unknown sender. You can switch to detection-only mode anytime in Settings.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_hubspot_not_here">HubSpot CRM is optional and is not set up here. You will be offered it once after setup, and can always connect it later from Settings.</string>

